    "message": "Renamed to VpnHood.AppHosting.Desktop.Daemon, with no change in what it holds: VpnHood's app packages are named by layer (AppLib is AppLogic, AppUi.Hosting is AppHosting, and the look is AppUi.Avalonia.Classic). This id receives no further updates.",
